r($,"aA6","afX",()=>{var q="beginner"
return A.c([A.c3("I eat breakfast every day.","Yo como desayuno cada d\xeda.","Se usa para acciones habituales y verdades generales. Estructura: Sujeto + Verbo (base) + complemento.",q,"Presente Simple (Simple Present)"),A.c3("I saw a cat. The cat was black.","Vi un gato. El gato era negro.","A y An se usan para cosas indefinidas. The se usa para cosas espec\xedficas o ya mencionadas.",q,"Art\xedculos (A/An/The)"),A.c3("One book \u2192 Two books / One box \u2192 Two boxes","Un libro \u2192 Dos libros / Una caja \u2192 Dos cajas","Generalmente se a\xf1ade -s al singular. Para nombres terminados en s, x, ch, sh se a\xf1ade -es.",q,"Plural de Sustantivos"),A.c3("She loves him. We help them.","Ella lo ama. Nosotros los ayudamos.","Sujetos: I, you, he, she, it, we, they. Objetos: me, you, him, her, it, us, them.",q,"Pronombres Personales"),A.c3("I am happy. They play soccer.","Yo estoy feliz. Ellos juegan f\xfatbol.","Estructura b\xe1sica: Sujeto + Verbo to be / Verbo principal + Complemento.",q,"Oraciones Afirmativas"),A.c3("I am not tired. She does not like fish.","Yo no estoy cansado. Ella no le gusta el pescado.","Con verbos to be: Sujeto + not + verbo. Con otros verbos: Sujeto + do/does + not + verbo.",q,"Oraciones Negativas"),A.c3("Are you a student? Does he work here?","\xbfEres estudiante? \xbf\xc9l trabaja aqu\xed?","Con verbos to be: Verbo + Sujeto + resto? Con otros verbos: Do/Does + Sujeto + verbo?",q,"Oraciones Interrogativas"),A.c3("There is a book on the table. There are three cats.","Hay un libro en la mesa. Hay tres gatos.","Se usa para indicar existencia. There is para singular, There are para plural.",q,"There is / There are"),A.c3("She has got blue eyes. They have got a big house.","Ella tiene ojos azules. Ellos tienen una casa grande.",'Equivale a "tener" en espa\xf1ol. Se usa principalmente en brit\xe1nico.',q,"Have got / Has got"),A.c3("What is your name? Where do you live?","\xbfCu\xe1l es tu nombre? \xbfD\xf3nde vives?","What (qu\xe9), Where (d\xf3nde), When (cu\xe1ndo), Who (qui\xe9n), Why (por qu\xe9), How (c\xf3mo).",q,"Palabras interrogativas")],A.a7("w<oc>"))})
r($,"aAa","amr",()=>{var q="intermediate"
return A.c([A.c3("I was reading when the phone rang.","Yo estaba leyendo cuando son\xf3 el tel\xe9fono.","Se usa para acciones en progreso en el pasado. Estructura: Sujeto + was/were + verbo-ing.",q,"Pasado Continuo (Past Continuous)"),A.c3("I have lived here for five years.","He vivido aqu\xed por cinco a\xf1os.","Se usa para acciones del pasado con relevancia en el presente. Estructura: Have/Has + Participio pasado.",q,"Presente Perfecto (Present Perfect)"),A.c3("She used to smoke, but now she doesn't.","Ella sol\xeda fumar, pero ahora no.","Expresa h\xe1bitos o estados pasados que ya no existen.",q,"Used to + Infinitivo"),A.c3("You should study more. Could you help me?","Deber\xedas estudiar m\xe1s. \xbfPodr\xedas ayudarme?","Expresan obligaci\xf3n, consejo, posibilidad y deseos.",q,"Modales: Must, Should, Could, Would"),A.c3("If it rains, I will stay home.","Si llueve, me quedar\xe9 en casa.","Situaciones reales o posibles. If + Presente Simple, will + Infinitivo.",q,"Condicionales Tipo 1"),A.c3("If I had more money, I would travel.","Si tuviera m\xe1s dinero, viajar\xeda.","Situaciones hipot\xe9ticas en el presente. If + Past Simple, would + Infinitivo.",q,"Condicionales Tipo 2"),A.c3("The cake was made by my mother.","El pastel fue hecho por mi madre.","Cuando el sujeto recibe la acci\xf3n. Estructura: Be + Past Participle.",q,"Voz Pasiva"),A.c3("She said that she was tired.","Ella dijo que estaba cansada.","Para informar lo que alguien dijo. Generalmente se retrocede un tiempo verbal.",q,"Reported Speech"),A.c3("The man who lives next door is a doctor.","El hombre que vive al lado es doctor.","Cl\xe1usulas que modifican sustantivos. Usan who, which, that, where, whose.",q,"Relative Clauses"),A.c3("I always wake up early. She rarely eats meat.","Siempre me despierto temprano. Ella rara vez come carne.","Always, usually, often, sometimes, rarely, never. Se colocan antes del verbo principal.",q,"Adverbios de Frecuencia")],A.a7("w<oc>"))})
r($,"aA2","amn",()=>{var q="advanced"
return A.c([A.c3("By the time I arrived, she had left.","Para cuando yo llegu\xe9, ella hab\xeda salido.","Acci\xf3n pasada anterior a otra acci\xf3n pasada. Had + Past Participle.",q,"Pasado Perfecto (Past Perfect)"),A.c3("If I had studied, I would have passed.","Si hubiera estudiado, habr\xeda aprobado.","Situaciones hipot\xe9ticas en el pasado (imposibles). If + Past Perfect, would have + Past Participle.",q,"Condicionales Tipo 3"),A.c3("Only if I had known. Never would I have imagined.","Solo si hubiera sabido. Nunca habr\xeda imaginado.","Para dar \xe9nfasis, se invierte el orden del sujeto y el verbo modal.",q,"Inversiones con Would/Could"),A.c3("I enjoy reading. He decided to leave. She made me laugh.","Disfruto leyendo. \xc9l decidi\xf3 irse. Ella me hizo re\xedr.","Verbos seguidos de otro verbo en diferentes formas.",q,"Cl\xe1usulas de Homologaci\xf3n (Catenative)"),A.c3("The project has been completed successfully.","El proyecto ha sido completado exitosamente.","Has been / Have been + Past Participle para enfatizar la acci\xf3n.",q,"Voz Pasiva Perfecta"),A.c3("I suggest that he leave early. It is essential that she be informed.","Sugiero que \xe9l se vaya temprano. Es esencial que ella sea informada.","Se usa para deseos, recomendaciones, importancia. En presente es igual al infinitivo.",q,"Subjuntivo"),A.c3("I wish I had studied harder for the exam.","Ojal\xe1 hubiera estudiado m\xe1s para el examen.","Expresa deseos sobre situaciones pasadas que no ocurrieron.",q,"Wish + Past Perfect"),A.c3("While walking, I found a wallet. Having finished, we left.","Mientras caminaba, encontr\xe9 una cartera. Habiendo terminado, nos fuimos.","Se pueden reducir cuando el sujeto es el mismo en ambas cl\xe1usulas.",q,"Cl\xe1usulas Reducidas (Reduced)"),A.c3("Rarely have I seen such a beautiful sunset.","Rara vez he visto un atardecer tan hermoso.","Para enfatizar, se invierte el sujeto y el verbo con ciertas palabras.",q,"Emphasis with Inversion"),A.c3("The United States, The Beatles, The piano, The French.","Estados Unidos, Los Beatles, El piano, Los franceses.","El uso de the con nombres geogr\xe1ficos, obras, nacionalidades, instrumentos.",q,"Art\xedculos en Contextos Especiales")],A.a7("w<oc>"))})
